;; First boot on a Raspberry Pi 5, headless: does the board come up, take an
;; address from the router, and let us in?
;;
;; Buildroot's own Pi 5 configuration, imported and round-tripped by silt
;; import, plus SSH so there is a way in without a screen or a serial cable.
;; The root password is feature:dev-ssh's development one. This image proves
;; the board and nothing else; it is not an appliance and must not leave
;; the bench.

(image raspberrypi5-bringup
  (compose
    image:raspberrypi5
    feature:dev-ssh)
  (verified-against (buildroot "2025.02.16")))
